@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
|Admin|
start
:Open Brand & Menu Management Console;
|OFDH System|
:Load and Display Existing Brands & Menu Items;
|Admin|
:Select CRUD Action (Create, Update, or Archive);
if (Action Selected?) then (Create Brand / MenuItem)
  :Input Name, EN/VI Descriptions, Unit Price & Hubs;
  |OFDH System|
  if (Valid Price > 0 & Unique Name?) then (Yes)
    :Insert Brand / MenuItem (isActive = true);
    :Link to Selected Hubs (HubMenuItem);
  else (No)
    :Display Validation Error;
    stop
  endif
elseif (Action Selected?) then (Update Brand / MenuItem)
  |Admin|
  :Modify Price, Description, or Hub Assignment;
  |OFDH System|
  :Validate & Update Database Record;
else (Delete / Archive Brand or MenuItem)
  |Admin|
  :Select Target Record & Confirm Deactivation;
  |OFDH System|
  :Set isActive = false (Archived State);
  :Hide from Customer Menu Browsing;
endif
:Display Updated Catalog Confirmation;
stop
@enduml
